cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HUDOC Researcher — ECtHR Case-Law Search & RAG"
message: >-
  Cite this software using the metadata below. Legal propositions and quoted
  paragraphs should additionally cite the authoritative HUDOC case record.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Szoszkiewicz"
    given-names: "Łukasz"
    email: "l.szoszkiewicz@amu.edu.pl"
    affiliation: "Adam Mickiewicz University, Poznań"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6671-2893"
  - family-names: "Marcisz"
    given-names: "Sebastian"
abstract: >-
  HUDOC Researcher is a source-first research environment for European Court
  of Human Rights case law. It combines paragraph-level structural search,
  judgment reading, citation analytics, case statistics, and semantic retrieval
  evaluated against the Court's official Case-Law Guides.
keywords:
  - "European Court of Human Rights"
  - "ECtHR"
  - "HUDOC"
  - "case law"
  - "human rights"
  - "legal information retrieval"
  - "semantic search"
  - "citation analysis"
  - "RAG"
